title trim page time ruler: the window ends at the take's end (marker 11:38, ZOOM 60 s): the last ruler label "12:08" ends at the window's right edge, inside the panel; every label and tick inside the frame, the label row under the waveform
sizes 480x480
ppmm 667
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_PAGE trim
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1
env CASSETTE_DEMO_TRIM_MARKER 698000

wait 600
shot ruler-end
expect text "ZOOM"
expect text "SAVE"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
